# Shared deny terms, stored as sha256 of the lowercased term so this file never names what it
# protects. checks/check-sanitised.py hashes every word span (up to 4 words) of every tracked file and
# fails on a match, reporting the place but never the term. Add a term with:
#   python3 checks/check-sanitised.py --hash "<term>" >> checks/denylist.sha256
